WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:07.055
Okay, so a design doc template is a fixed outline for proposing a change before I build it,

2
00:00:07.055 --> 00:00:10.478
so reviewers can compare it with the options I rejected.

3
00:00:10.478 --> 00:00:12.433
It first states the problem,

4
00:00:12.858 --> 00:00:16.253
like an export service whose records live in memory,

5
00:00:16.263 --> 00:00:18.493
so a restart erases them.

6
00:00:18.507 --> 00:00:21.567
Every alternative needs a reason it was rejected,

7
00:00:21.662 --> 00:00:23.647
and the first is doing nothing,

8
00:00:23.777 --> 00:00:26.267
because if I can't say what that costs,

9
00:00:26.462 --> 00:00:29.407
reviewers can't weigh my proposal against it.

10
00:00:29.407 --> 00:00:31.347
So before review,

11
00:00:31.642 --> 00:00:33.162
I run the checker,

12
00:00:33.162 --> 00:00:37.507
which fails a doc marked Accepted that still lists an open question.
